# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# SIYMON build configuration (all optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base path used by Vite for every asset URL.
# - Local development:            leave unset (defaults to "/")
# - GitHub Pages (project site):  set to "/<your-repository-name>/"
#   e.g. for https://<user>.github.io/<repo>/  ->  SIYMON_BASE=/<repo>/
# The GitHub Actions workflow in .github/workflows/deploy.yml sets this
# automatically from the repository name, so you normally never edit it.
# SIYMON_BASE=/
